{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26309","headline":"文祝延二阕 一 · 沈亚之","name":"文祝延二阕 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闽山之杭杭兮水堋堋，吞荒抱大兮香叠层。\n腾气清浑兮朝昏，神生其中兮宅幽凝。\n居如山兮惠如水，处端卓兮赴下而忘鄙。\n集人之祈兮从人之所市，攀清明兮叩髣髴。\n我民清兮期吉日，愿听诚兮陈所当。\n侯临我兮恩如光，照导兮天覆。\n惠流吾兮乐且康，恭闻侯兮饮食失常。\n民萦忧兮心苦疮，饱我之饥兮侯由有谷。\n神有泽兮宜荫沃，脱侯之恙兮归侯之多福。\n羣卑勤之恭洁兮，鉴贞盟乎山竹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈亚之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26309.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26309","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}